"盘屿没能以读写方式挂载这块盘，磁盘仍可只读使用，数据不受影响。请重启 Mac 后重新插入；仍然出现时，请在设置 → 支持中导出诊断并反馈。" = "Volisle couldn’t mount this disk with write access. It’s still readable, and your data isn’t affected. Restart your Mac and connect the disk again; if this keeps happening, export diagnostics in Settings → Support and send feedback.";
"盘屿的文件系统扩展没有为这块盘开启写入，磁盘保持只读，数据不受影响。请确认磁盘或读卡器的写保护开关没有锁上；如果这块盘上次写入时被直接拔掉，请接回 Windows 打开一次，安全弹出后再插回。" = "Volisle’s file system extension didn’t turn on writing for this disk, so it stays read-only and your data isn’t affected. Make sure the write-protect switch on the disk or card reader isn’t locked. If the disk was unplugged while writing last time, connect it to Windows, open it once, eject it safely, and connect it again.";
"这块盘上次读写时被直接断开。插回后盘屿要先把盘恢复到断开前的一致状态，但恢复前的安全核对没有通过，为保护数据保持只读，没有做任何修改。盘里的文件仍可只读打开和拷出。请在设置 → 支持中导出诊断并反馈；急用时可以接回 Windows 检查磁盘（属性 → 工具 → 检查），安全弹出后再插回。" = "This disk was disconnected while being written to. Volisle first returns such a disk to its consistent state from before the disconnection, but the safety check before doing so didn’t pass, so the disk stays read-only and nothing was changed. You can still open and copy its files. Export diagnostics in Settings → Support and send them to us; if you need the disk right away, check it in Windows (Properties → Tools → Check), eject it safely, and connect it again.";
"这块盘上次读写时被直接断开，盘屿这次没能完成恢复，磁盘保持只读，数据不受影响。请拔下后重新插入再试；仍然出现时，请在设置 → 支持中导出诊断并反馈。" = "This disk was disconnected while being written to, and Volisle couldn’t finish restoring it this time, so it stays read-only and your data isn’t affected. Unplug it and connect it again to retry. If this keeps happening, export diagnostics in Settings → Support and send them to us.";
"这块盘处于写保护状态，只能读取。请检查磁盘或读卡器上的写保护（锁定）开关，拨开后重新插入。" = "This disk is write-protected, so it can only be read. Check the write-protect (lock) switch on the disk or card reader, unlock it, and connect the disk again.";
"按顺序打开下面三项，每项设置一次即可。打开后会自动打勾。" = "Turn these on in order; each needs setting only once. Each one ticks itself when it’s on.";
"还需允许盘屿读取磁盘：在“系统设置 → 隐私与安全性 → 完全磁盘访问”中打开“盘屿”。" = "Volisle still needs permission to read disks: turn on Volisle in System Settings → Privacy & Security → Full Disk Access.";
