"点下面的按钮，系统设置会打开“登录项与扩展”。在“允许在后台”里找到“盘屿”，打开右边的开关。系统可能要求输入这台 Mac 的登录密码。" = "Click the button below to open Login Items & Extensions in System Settings. Under Allow in the Background, find Volisle and turn on its switch. You may be asked for your Mac login password.";
"点下面的按钮，系统设置会打开“文件系统扩展”列表。打开“盘屿 NTFS”（有的系统显示为“Volisle NTFS”）右边的开关，再点“完成”。在“按 App”页面里盘屿下面的“FSKit Modules”开关不用管。" = "Click the button below to open the File System Extensions list in System Settings, turn on the switch next to “Volisle NTFS”, then click Done. You can ignore the “FSKit Modules” switch on the By App page.";
"点下面的按钮，系统设置会打开“完全磁盘访问”。找到“盘屿”，打开右边的开关。列表里没有盘屿时，点列表下方的“+”，在“应用程序”里选择“盘屿”。如果系统提示退出并重新打开，选“稍后”即可。" = "Click the button below to open Full Disk Access in System Settings. Find Volisle and turn on its switch. If Volisle isn’t in the list, click + below the list and choose Volisle in Applications. If you’re asked to quit and reopen, choose Later.";
