"以后也可以在设置 → 首次使用中继续。" = "You can also finish this later in Settings → Setup.";
"稍后设置" = "Later";
"“盘屿 NTFS”的开关打不开或会自己弹回去？请确认电脑上只有一个盘屿、并且是从“应用程序”文件夹打开的；仍然不行就重启 Mac 后再试。“FSKit Modules”那个开关不用打开。" = "Switch next to “Volisle NTFS” won’t turn on, or turns itself off? Make sure there is only one copy of Volisle and you opened it from the Applications folder. If it still won’t stay on, restart your Mac and try again. You don’t need to turn on “FSKit Modules”.";
"这块盘被标记为需要检查，为保护数据暂时只读。可以点上面的“在 Mac 上检查…”，也可以在 Windows 中检查后安全弹出再插回。" = "This disk is marked as needing a check, so it stays read-only to protect your data. Click “Check on This Mac…” above, or check it in Windows, eject it safely, then reconnect it.";
"写入过程中发生错误，盘屿已停止写入以保护数据。点“恢复只读”可尝试结束写入会话；后续恢复可能撤销出错前约 20 秒内的改动。排除故障并通过安全核验后，才能重新开启读写。" = "An error occurred while writing, so Volisle stopped writing to protect your data. Click “Restore Read-Only” to try to end the write session; subsequent recovery may undo changes from about the last 20 seconds before the error. Writing can be enabled again once the cause is resolved and safety checks pass.";
"“%@”正在读写，期间不能用盘屿推出其他磁盘。请在 Finder 中推出“%@”，或先推出“%@”。" = "“%@” is open for writing, so Volisle can’t eject other disks now. Eject “%@” in Finder, or eject “%@” first.";
"磁盘映像只能读取，盘屿不为它开启读写。" = "Disk images are read-only; Volisle doesn’t turn on writing for them.";
"这块盘处于写保护状态（例如 SD 卡侧面的锁定开关拨到了 Lock），只能读取。" = "This disk is write-protected (for example, the lock switch on the side of an SD card is set to Lock), so it can only be read.";
"这块盘没有分区表，整块盘直接格式化成了 NTFS，盘屿暂不为这种盘开启读写，可以正常读取。" = "This disk has no partition table (the whole disk was formatted as NTFS). Volisle doesn’t turn on writing for such disks yet; you can still read it.";
"盘屿目前只为通过 USB 连接的硬盘和 U 盘开启读写；雷雳、内置读卡器等连接方式尚未验证，这块盘可以正常读取。" = "Volisle turns on writing only for drives connected over USB. Thunderbolt, built-in card readers and other connections haven’t been verified yet; you can still read this disk.";
"命令长时间没有完成，已停止。" = "The command didn’t finish in time and was stopped.";
"还差最后 1 步。这个开关 macOS 要求你亲自打开，只需设置一次。" = "One step to go. macOS asks you to turn this switch on yourself; you only do it once.";
"移除盘屿的后台组件？" = "Remove Volisle’s background component?";
"移除" = "Remove";
"移除后插入的 NTFS 磁盘将只能读取，直到重新设置后台组件。卸载盘屿前才需要这样做。" = "After removing it, connected NTFS disks can only be read until you set up the background component again. You only need to do this before uninstalling Volisle.";
"上次磁盘请求的本机记录无法读取，重启 Mac 后盘屿会自动核对并解除暂停。" = "The record of the last disk request on this Mac can’t be read. After you restart the Mac, Volisle checks it automatically and resumes.";
"盘屿还在结束这块盘的读写或检查，完成后会自动核验，请稍后再推出。" = "Volisle is still ending read-write or checking on this disk. It checks again automatically when that finishes; eject the disk after that.";
"盘屿的文件系统扩展意外退出，这块盘暂时无法读写，也无法推出。请重启 Mac 后再使用这块盘；重新连接时会自动回到最后一致的状态，退出前约 20 秒内的改动会被撤销。" = "Volisle’s file system extension quit unexpectedly, so this disk can’t be read, written, or ejected for now. Restart your Mac before using the disk again. When it’s connected again, it returns to its last consistent state automatically; changes from about the last 20 seconds before the extension quit are undone.";
"检查发现这块盘的文件记录有问题，没有做任何修改。盘里的文件仍可以只读打开和拷出；要恢复读写，请在 Windows 中检查磁盘（属性 → 工具 → 检查）。" = "The check found a problem with this disk’s file records, so nothing was changed. You can still open and copy its files read-only. To write to it again, check it in Windows (Properties → Tools → Check).";
"检查时有一部分内容读不出来（可能是坏扇区，或数据线、USB 接口不稳），检查没有完成，没有做任何修改。可以换根数据线或换个接口再试，或在 Windows 中检查磁盘（属性 → 工具 → 检查）。" = "Part of the disk couldn’t be read during the check (a bad sector, or an unstable cable or USB port), so the check didn’t finish and nothing was changed. Try another cable or port, or check the disk in Windows (Properties → Tools → Check).";
"暂不支持这块盘的加密方式。盘屿可以打开已完成加密、用密码或恢复密钥保护的 BitLocker 盘（XTS-AES、AES-CBC）；Windows 7 默认的“带扩散器的 AES”不支持，正在加密或解密中的盘请等 Windows 完成后再试。" = "This disk’s encryption method isn’t supported yet. Volisle opens fully encrypted BitLocker disks (XTS-AES, AES-CBC) protected by a password or recovery key; Windows 7’s default “AES with Diffuser” isn’t supported. If Windows is still encrypting or decrypting the disk, wait until it finishes and try again.";
"技术信息：%@" = "Technical details: %@";
"拷贝记录无效。" = "The copy record is invalid.";
"无法读取“%@”：%@" = "Couldn’t read “%@”: %@";
