"由盘屿拷贝：拔线后插回，会核对已拷的部分并从断点接着拷。也可以把文件拖到这里。" = "Volisle copies the items: if the disk is unplugged, it checks what was already copied when you connect it again and continues from there. You can also drag items here.";
