"盘已断开或已推出，插回并开启读写后会自动继续。" = "The disk was disconnected or ejected. Connect it and turn on write access to continue automatically.";
"磁盘写入已中断。请先恢复只读，排除故障后重新开启读写；任务会核对未完成部分并接着拷。" = "Disk writes have stopped. Restore read-only access first, resolve the problem, then enable writing again; the copy will check the unfinished portion and continue.";
