"这块盘目前无法写入，恢复可写后会自动继续。" = "The disk cannot be written to right now. The copy continues automatically once write access is restored.";
"已暂停。" = "Paused.";
"这台 Mac 上的写入恢复记录使用了当前盘屿不支持的格式，磁盘保持只读，原记录已保留。请使用支持该记录的盘屿版本恢复；需要帮助时，在设置 → 支持中导出诊断并反馈。" = "The write recovery records on this Mac use a format this version of Volisle cannot read. The disk remains read-only and the records have been preserved. Recover using a version of Volisle that supports these records. For help, export diagnostics in Settings → Support and contact support.";
"磁盘当前无法写入，请按恢复提示处理。" = "The disk cannot be written to right now. Follow the recovery instructions.";
"这块盘在同一个文件的位置反复出现读写错误（多半是硬盘有坏道），续传已停止，避免硬盘反复掉线。可以把这个文件拷到别的盘，或点“跳过此项”；换线、换接口后仍想再试可以点“重试”。" = "This disk keeps failing to read or write at the same file (most likely bad sectors), so the copy stopped resuming on its own to keep the disk from dropping off again and again. Copy this file to another disk, or click Skip This Item; to try again after changing the cable or port, click Try Again.";
"上次写入时这块盘出现读写错误（可能是坏道，或数据线、接口、供电不稳）。" = "The disk reported a read or write error last time (bad sectors, or an unstable cable, port or power supply).";
"硬盘报告的读写错误" = "Errors reported by the disk";
"正在查看最近 24 小时的系统记录…" = "Looking through the last 24 hours of system records…";
"无法读取系统记录（需要管理员账户）。" = "System records couldn’t be read (this needs an administrator account).";
"最近 24 小时没有记录到读写错误。" = "No read or write errors in the last 24 hours.";
"最近 24 小时，硬盘在 %lld 处位置报告了无法读取的扇区（共 %lld 次），多半是坏道。写到这些位置附近时读写会中断，硬盘可能掉线。请尽快把重要文件拷出，再用硬盘厂商的检测工具检查。" = "In the last 24 hours the disk reported unreadable sectors at %lld places (%lld times in all), most likely bad sectors. Reading or writing near them stops, and the disk may drop off. Copy important files off it soon, then check it with the manufacturer’s diagnostic tool.";
"最近 24 小时，硬盘报告了 %lld 次读写错误（不是坏道），多半是数据线、USB 接口、扩展坞或供电不稳。换根线、换个接口，或接到带电源的扩展坞再试。" = "In the last 24 hours the disk reported %lld read or write errors that aren’t bad sectors, most likely an unstable cable, USB port, hub or power supply. Try another cable or port, or a powered hub.";
"无读写错误" = "no read or write errors";
"—— 硬盘报告的读写错误（最近 24 小时）——" = "—— Errors reported by the disks (last 24 hours) ——";
