"其他 NTFS 工具" = "another NTFS tool";
"这块盘现在交给了“%@”，盘屿没有接管它，读写和权限都由“%@”负责。想改用盘屿：先推出这块盘，再到“系统设置 → 通用 → 登录项与扩展 → 文件系统扩展”中关掉“%@”（或退出这个工具），然后重新插上。两个工具都开着时，系统可能每次都把盘交给“%@”。" = "This disk was handed to “%@”, not Volisle, so writing and permissions here are up to “%@”. To use Volisle instead, eject the disk, turn off “%@” in System Settings → General → Login Items & Extensions → File System Extensions (or quit that tool), then plug the disk in again. While both are on, macOS may keep giving the disk to “%@”.";
"由 %@ 接管" = "Handled by %@";
"打开文件系统扩展设置" = "Open File System Extensions Settings";
"由 %@ 接管，盘屿未处理" = "Handled by %@, not by Volisle";
"Windows 在这块盘上还有没做完的维护（例如被中断的磁盘检查），只有 Windows 能完成，盘屿没有做任何修改。请接回 Windows 打开一次，安全弹出后再插回。" = "Windows has unfinished maintenance on this disk (such as an interrupted disk check) that only Windows can complete. Volisle changed nothing. Connect it to Windows, open it once, eject it safely, then connect it again.";
"这块盘的 NTFS 日志读不出来或无法按顺序补写，盘屿不能代替 Windows 恢复，没有做任何修改。请接回 Windows 打开一次，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回。" = "This disk’s NTFS log can’t be read or replayed in order, so Volisle can’t recover it in place of Windows. Nothing was changed. Connect it to Windows, open it once, eject it with “Safely Remove Hardware”, then connect it again.";
"补写或之后的检查没有通过，盘屿已经把这块盘原样还原，没有留下任何改动。盘里的文件仍可只读打开和拷出；请接回 Windows 打开一次，安全弹出后再插回。" = "The replay or the check after it didn’t pass, so Volisle put the disk back exactly as it was; no changes were left. Files can still be opened and copied read-only. Connect it to Windows, open it once, eject it safely, then connect it again.";
"补写中途失败，而且没能完全还原。请不要在 Mac 上继续写入这块盘，尽快接回 Windows，在“属性 → 工具 → 检查”中检查磁盘。" = "The replay failed midway and the disk couldn’t be fully put back. Don’t write to this disk on the Mac; connect it to Windows as soon as you can and check it in Properties → Tools → Check.";
"这块盘上次在 Windows 中没有安全弹出，为保护数据暂时只读。最稳妥的是接回 Windows，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回；手边没有 Windows 时，可以点“在 Mac 上恢复…”。" = "This disk wasn’t ejected safely from Windows last time, so it’s read-only to protect your data. The safest fix is to connect it to Windows and eject it with “Safely Remove Hardware”; if no Windows PC is at hand, click “Recover on This Mac…”.";
"已有操作正在进行。" = "Another operation is in progress.";
"只有在 Windows 开着机时直接拔下的盘，才能在 Mac 上补写。请把盘接回那台 Windows 开机，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回。" = "Only a disk unplugged while Windows was running can be replayed on the Mac. Connect it to that Windows PC, start it, eject the disk with “Safely Remove Hardware”, then connect it again.";
"在 Mac 上恢复…" = "Recover on This Mac…";
"这块盘上次在 Windows 中没有安全弹出，为保护数据暂时只读。最稳妥的是接回 Windows，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回；手边没有 Windows 时，可以点上面的“在 Mac 上恢复…”。" = "This disk wasn’t ejected safely from Windows last time, so it’s read-only to protect your data. The safest fix is to connect it to Windows and eject it with “Safely Remove Hardware”; if no Windows PC is at hand, click “Recover on This Mac…” above.";
"这块盘上次在 Windows 中没有安全弹出，所以以只读方式打开。请接回 Windows，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回（加密盘暂不支持在 Mac 上恢复）。" = "This disk wasn’t ejected safely from Windows last time, so it opened read-only. Connect it to Windows and eject it with “Safely Remove Hardware”, then connect it again (recovering on the Mac isn’t available for encrypted disks yet).";
"在 Mac 上恢复“%@”" = "Recover “%@” on This Mac";
"正在只读检查这块盘…" = "Checking the disk read-only…";
"不会修改盘上的任何内容。" = "Nothing on the disk is changed.";
"正在补写并检查…" = "Replaying and checking…";
"这块盘的日志已经是完成状态，不需要补写。点“好”为它开启读写。" = "This disk’s log is already complete; nothing needs replaying. Click OK to turn on write access.";
"补写了 %lld 笔改动，检查了 %lld 个文件和文件夹，没有发现问题。点“好”为这块盘开启读写。" = "Replayed %lld changes and checked %lld files and folders; no problems found. Click OK to turn on write access for this disk.";
"没有恢复" = "Not Recovered";
"补写并开启读写" = "Replay and Turn On Writing";
"没有“需要检查”标记" = "Not marked “needs check”";
"Windows 曾发现这块盘有问题，不只是没有安全弹出。" = "Windows found a problem with this disk, beyond not being ejected safely.";
"没有 Windows 休眠或未完成的维护" = "No Windows hibernation or unfinished maintenance";
"NTFS 日志已经是完成状态" = "The NTFS log is already complete";
"日志版本 %@" = "Log version %@";
"可以按顺序补写" = "Can be replayed in order";
"模拟补写成功：改动都已写在盘上，只需把日志标记为完成。" = "Simulated replay succeeded: every change is already on the disk; only the log needs marking complete.";
"模拟补写成功：有 %lld 笔 Windows 已确认的改动等待写入。" = "Simulated replay succeeded: %lld changes Windows had confirmed are waiting to be written.";
"这块盘是怎么从 Windows 上拿下来的？" = "How Did This Disk Leave Windows?";
"Windows 开着机，没有点“安全删除硬件”就直接拔了" = "Unplugged while Windows was running, without “Safely Remove Hardware”";
"Windows 关机、重启或睡眠之后才拔的" = "Unplugged after Windows shut down, restarted or went to sleep";
"记不清了" = "Not sure";
"补写前，盘屿会把要改动的部分原样备份；补写后检查全部文件记录，任何一步不通过都会原样还原。和 Windows 一样，拔线那一刻正在写的文件可能不完整。" = "Before replaying, Volisle backs up exactly what it will change; afterwards it checks every file record, and if any step fails the disk is put back as it was. As with Windows, a file being written at the moment of unplugging may be incomplete.";
"记不清时按关机处理更稳妥：请把盘接回那台 Windows 开机，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回。暂时没有条件的话，盘现在可以只读打开，需要的文件可以先拷出来。" = "If you’re not sure, treat it as a shutdown: connect the disk to that Windows PC, start it, eject it with “Safely Remove Hardware”, then connect it again. Until then the disk opens read-only, so you can copy off what you need.";
"盘上看不出是直接拔线，还是 Windows 开着“快速启动”关机后才拔，所以需要你确认。" = "The disk can’t show whether it was simply unplugged or removed after Windows shut down with Fast Startup, so please confirm.";
"符合" = "Met";
"不符合" = "Not met";
"后台组件还在处理这块盘，请不要拔下它。等几分钟后在盘屿里点“刷新”；仍然没有挂上时，拔下后重新插入。" = "The background component is still working on this disk; don’t unplug it. Wait a few minutes, then click Refresh in Volisle; if the disk still isn’t mounted, unplug it and connect it again.";
"正在 Mac 上恢复磁盘，请勿拔出…" = "Recovering the disk on this Mac. Don’t unplug it…";
"正在补写这块盘" = "Replaying this disk’s log";
"用“拷贝到这块盘…”拷贝时，Mac 不会因为闲置而睡眠，屏幕仍会按系统设置关闭。合上笔记本或手动选择睡眠时仍会睡眠，拷贝随之暂停，醒来后磁盘重新开启读写就会接着拷。" = "While copying with “Copy to This Disk…”, the Mac won’t sleep from being idle; the display still turns off as set in System Settings. Closing a laptop’s lid or choosing Sleep still sleeps the Mac: the copy pauses and continues once the disk is writable again after waking.";
"拷贝期间不让 Mac 自动睡眠" = "Keep the Mac awake while copying";
"盘屿正在拷贝文件到磁盘" = "Volisle is copying files to a disk";
"没能检查这块盘" = "Couldn’t Check the Disk";
"没有做任何修改。" = "Nothing was changed. ";
"需要先确认放弃 Windows 没写完的改动。" = "First confirm that Windows’ unfinished changes may be given up.";
"放弃未写完的改动并开启读写" = "Give Up Unfinished Changes and Turn On Writing";
"不能按顺序补写" = "Can’t be replayed in order";
"不补写，盘上也完整" = "Consistent without the replay";
"清掉日志前，盘屿会把要改动的部分原样备份，任何一步不通过都会原样还原。" = "Before clearing the log, Volisle backs up exactly what it will change; if any step fails, the disk is put back as it was.";
"我知道 Windows 最后没写完的改动会被放弃" = "I understand that Windows’ last unfinished changes will be given up";
"放弃 Windows 没写完的改动" = "Give Up Windows’ Unfinished Changes";
"这块盘上次在 Windows 中没有安全弹出。盘屿先只读检查，再告诉你能怎样处理。" = "This disk wasn’t ejected safely from Windows last time. Volisle checks it read-only first, then tells you what can be done.";
"正在清理日志…" = "Clearing the log…";
"请不要拔下这块盘。要改动的部分会先原样备份，任何一步不通过都会还原。" = "Don’t unplug the disk. What will change is backed up first, and the disk is put back if any step fails.";
"已恢复，可以开启读写" = "Recovered—Ready for Writing";
"已放弃 Windows 没写完的改动，检查了 %lld 个文件和文件夹，文件占用的空间都标记正确。" = "Windows’ unfinished changes were given up. Checked %lld files and folders; the space files use is marked correctly. ";
"另有约 %@ 空间被 Windows 预留但没有用上，不影响数据，在 Windows 中检查磁盘可以收回。" = "About %@ that Windows reserved but never used stays marked as used; it doesn’t affect your data and a disk check on Windows reclaims it. ";
"点“好”为这块盘开启读写。" = "Click OK to turn on write access for this disk.";
"日志已经是完成状态" = "The Log Is Already Complete";
"不需要补写，可以直接开启读写。" = "Nothing needs replaying; write access can be turned on.";
"可以在 Mac 上补写" = "Can Be Replayed on This Mac";
"和 Windows 下次插上这块盘时一样，把没写完的改动补上，再开启读写。" = "Completes the unfinished changes the way Windows would the next time the disk is connected, then turns on write access.";
"补写不了，但盘上数据完整" = "Can’t Be Replayed, but the Disk Is Consistent";
"可以放弃 Windows 最后没写完的改动，然后开启读写。" = "Windows’ last unfinished changes can be given up, then write access turned on.";
"需要接回 Windows 处理" = "Needs Windows";
"日志里的改动对不上盘上的现状，见下面的技术信息。" = "The changes in the log don’t match what’s on the disk; see the technical information below.";
"NTFS 日志读不出来" = "The NTFS log can’t be read";
"检查了 %lld 个文件和文件夹：记录都能读到，文件占用的空间都标记为已用。" = "Checked %lld files and folders: every record can be read, and the space files use is marked as used.";
"检查发现问题，见下面的技术信息。" = "The check found a problem; see the technical information below.";
"技术信息" = "Technical Information";
"ntfsrecover：%@" = "ntfsrecover: %@";
"检查：%@" = "Check: %@";
"标记为已用但没有文件使用：%@" = "Marked used but used by no file: %@";
"检查结果" = "Findings";
"Windows 10/11 默认开着“快速启动”：关机或睡眠时，一部分改动只留在那台 Windows 里，盘上看不出来，只有它开机后才会写回盘上。在 Mac 上处理会丢掉这些改动，所以请把盘接回那台 Windows 开机，用“安全删除硬件”弹出后再插回。" = "Windows 10 and 11 have Fast Startup on by default: when shutting down or sleeping, some changes stay only in that Windows PC, invisible on the disk, and are written back when it starts again. Handling the disk on the Mac would lose them, so connect it to that Windows PC, start it, eject the disk with “Safely Remove Hardware”, then connect it again.";
"拔线前最后几秒的改动可能没有生效，例如文件夹里显示的文件大小或时间还是旧的。" = "Changes from the last few seconds before unplugging may not take effect—for example, a folder may still show a file’s old size or time.";
"文件内容和上面检查过的结构不受影响。" = "File contents and the structure checked above aren’t affected.";
"约 %@ 空间被 Windows 预留但没有用上，会一直显示为已用，直到在 Windows 中检查磁盘。" = "About %@ that Windows reserved but never used stays marked as used until the disk is checked on Windows.";
"Linux 上的 NTFS-3G 遇到这种盘默认也是这样处理。下次接到 Windows 时，建议在“属性 → 工具 → 检查”中检查一次。" = "NTFS-3G on Linux handles such disks the same way by default. Next time the disk is on Windows, consider checking it in Properties → Tools → Check.";
"后台服务（launchd）：%@" = "Background service (launchd): %@";
"launchd 中没有这个服务（未注册或已被移除）" = "not in launchd (not registered, or removed)";
"无法读取" = "unreadable";
"想改用盘屿，按顺序做三步：" = "To use Volisle instead, follow these three steps:";
"推出这块盘" = "Eject this disk";
"在“文件系统扩展”里关掉“%@”（或退出这个工具）" = "Turn off “%@” in File System Extensions (or quit that tool)";
"重新插上这块盘，盘屿会自动开启读写" = "Connect the disk again; Volisle turns on write access automatically";
"只关掉开关还不够：拔下重插之前，这块盘会一直挂在“%@”上。两个工具都开着时，系统可能每次都把盘交给“%@”。" = "Turning the switch off isn’t enough: until it’s unplugged and connected again, the disk stays mounted by “%@”. While both are on, macOS may keep giving the disk to “%@”.";
"这块盘现在由“%@”挂载，盘屿没有接管它，读写和权限都由“%@”负责。" = "This disk is mounted by “%@”, not Volisle, so writing and permissions here are up to “%@”.";
